{"id":"1e36ef17b6856ad1","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-truth.md","title":"Solovay Arithmetical Truth Lemma","display":"lem-solovay-truth — Solovay Arithmetical Truth Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-truth","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-truth"],"display":"lem-solovay-truth — Solovay Arithmetical Truth Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-lem-solovay-limit-properties]]","[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-truth — Solovay Arithmetical Truth Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2adc36a611449e23\" href=\"?note=2adc36a611449e23\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-limit-properties\">89-lem-solovay-limit-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b68cd750e79cac\" href=\"?note=97b68cd750e79cac\" title=\"89-df-solovay-realization\">89-df-solovay-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76b37345e1a3ad95\" href=\"?note=76b37345e1a3ad95\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-self-reference\">89-lem-solovay-self-reference</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 是上述有限有根 GL 模型。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>将其扩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&#39;=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\">\\(M&#39;=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in V&#39;(p)\">\\(0\\in V&#39;(p)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\in V(p)\">\\(1\\in V(p)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V&#39;(p)\\cap W=V(p)\">\\(V&#39;(p)\\cap W=V(p)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>用同一极限句族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S_i)_{i\\in W&#39;}\">\\((S_i)_{i\\in W&#39;}\\)</span> 与自然指标枚举构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\sigma\">\\(\\tau_\\sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 取固定经典算术证明关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 遍历全部单模态公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq (W\\times W)\">\\(R\\subseteq (W\\times W)\\)</span> 传递、非自反，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)\">\\(\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\">\\(W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\">\\(R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)\">\\(\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)\\)</span> 的同一见证以及其中同一 PA 证明环境。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\sigma\">\\(\\tau_\\sigma\\)</span> 取模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\prime\">\\(M\\prime\\)</span>、下式枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 与句族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的 Solovay 实现，不使用任意其他句族。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\forall i\\in W\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\\\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\tau_\\sigma(B),&amp;M,i\\models B,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\neg\\tau_\\sigma(B),&amp;M,i\\not\\models B.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\forall i\\in W\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\\\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\tau_\\sigma(B),&amp;M,i\\models B,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\neg\\tau_\\sigma(B),&amp;M,i\\not\\models B.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nV&#39;(q)&amp;\\coloneqq V(q)\\cup\\{i\\in\\{0\\}\\mid1\\in V(q)\\}\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\nM\\prime&amp;\\coloneqq(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;),\\\\\ne&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;n+1\\},\\quad\nL\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,S_i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;n+1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nV&#39;(q)&amp;\\coloneqq V(q)\\cup\\{i\\in\\{0\\}\\mid1\\in V(q)\\}\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\nM\\prime&amp;\\coloneqq(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;),\\\\\ne&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;n+1\\},\\quad\nL\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,S_i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;n+1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 127–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 结构归纳；原子情形用极限句互斥性，布尔情形用经典演算。盒为真时用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[D_i]\">\\(S_i\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[D_i]\\)</span> 及后继归纳假设；盒为假时取假后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_j]\">\\(S_i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_j]\\)</span> 排除被解释的盒可证。原书 pp.128–129 给出内部推导。\n量化明确限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge1\">\\(i\\ge1\\)</span>，新增根 0 的内部忠实性不由本条保证。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\sigma\">\\(\\tau_\\sigma\\)</span> 必须来自自指极限句，不能套用于任意参数化句族。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-solovay-limit-properties","status":"resolved","id":"2adc36a611449e23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-limit-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-solovay-realization","status":"resolved","id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-solovay-self-reference","status":"resolved","id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"M'=(W',R',V')","display":false},{"tex":"0\\in V'(p)","display":false},{"tex":"1\\in V(p)","display":false},{"tex":"V'(p)\\cap W=V(p)","display":false},{"tex":"(S_i)_{i\\in W'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq (W\\times W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"W'=W\\cup\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R'=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M\\prime","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\forall i\\in W\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\\\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\tau_\\sigma(B),&M,i\\models B,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\neg\\tau_\\sigma(B),&M,i\\not\\models B.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nV'(q)&\\coloneqq V(q)\\cup\\{i\\in\\{0\\}\\mid1\\in V(q)\\}\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\nM\\prime&\\coloneqq(W',R',V'),\\\\\ne&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle\\mid i<n+1\\},\\quad\nL\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,S_i\\rangle\\mid i<n+1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"S_i\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[D_i]","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"S_i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_j]","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2427,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7050f6732cc53d7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9e926c452321080c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] → [[89-lem-solovay-limit-proper